- Hey everyone, this is Jeremy Schieffelin

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.760
with Khan Academy.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.080
Thanks so much for
joining us this afternoon.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.360
